WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.749
- The NFC North is as cold as ever.

00:00:01.958 --> 00:00:02.749
The Packers are the front,

00:00:02.999 --> 00:00:04.999
and in the back we’re forced to eat tough losses.

